# Build tools for the AppImage, pinned by content.
#
# linuxdeploy publishes only a rolling "continuous" tag, so the URL alone guarantees nothing about
# what gets executed during a release build. Recording the digest turns a silent upstream swap into
# a failed build. Refresh a line deliberately, never to make an error go away.
#
# sha256  filename  url
36a2d7e274d12e1050d0e9ecfe11d339ed54720b2bec464c286d53f8b07f5c62  linuxdeploy  https://github.com/linuxdeploy/linuxdeploy/releases/download/continuous/linuxdeploy-x86_64.AppImage
cfc1055b2b9dbc08412b579f20990b7b41a17b61beaa5847dc9477c96c9e9617  linuxdeploy-plugin-qt  https://github.com/linuxdeploy/linuxdeploy-plugin-qt/releases/download/continuous/linuxdeploy-plugin-qt-x86_64.AppImage
c107b49d84edbffc6ab226ed1007e0626a4f7aa2c3a36b7782bef62351d49e94  linuxdeploy-plugin-gstreamer  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/linuxdeploy/linuxdeploy-plugin-gstreamer/2a2e67491c32995a3f279ad0ecbe77abd512b42a/linuxdeploy-plugin-gstreamer.sh
